  "title": "Markdown root route leaks Latest topic list on login_required sites",
  "summary": "### Impact\r\nDiscourse contains an authentication bypass affecting login-required sites with Markdown endpoints enabled.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nDisable the feature via the `enable_markdown_endpoints` site setting. \r\n\r\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-GPGS4NF7.",
